    "engine": "cadquery",
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "thumbnail": "/logo.png",
    "description": {
      "en": "Tablaco v2 — a truth table you can hold. Cells are cubes of two press-fit half-shells (white = V, dark = F) with snap-fit beams inherited from v1's research; they stack Lego-style on notched rails with a castellated crown giving 45-degree rotation detents. V is sunken, F raised — read by fingertip before the letter. The operator key makes each connective physical: its pin pattern is derived from the truth-table engine, so it sits flush only over a correct column. Dual-engine: exact CadQuery B-Rep for parts and STEP export, plus a WASM OpenSCAD preview mode that re-renders live as you drag sliders. (c) Xochitl Martinez Nava; MADFAM portfolio licence.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Tablaco v2 — una tabla de verdad que puedes sostener. Las celdas son cubos de dos medias conchas a presion (blanco = V, oscuro = F) con vigas snap-fit heredadas de la investigacion de v1; se apilan estilo Lego sobre rieles con muescas, con una corona almenada que da detentes de rotacion a 45 grados. La V va hundida y la F en relieve — se lee con la yema antes que la letra. La llave operadora hace fisico cada conectivo: su patron de pines se deriva del motor de tablas de verdad, asi que solo asienta plana sobre una columna correcta. Doble motor: CadQuery B-Rep exacto para piezas y STEP, mas un modo de vista previa OpenSCAD WASM que re-renderiza en vivo al mover los controles. (c) Xochitl Martinez Nava; licencia de portafolio MADFAM.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
